<title>USA: Information Analysis sets 3-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Information Analysis sets 3-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>DUNN LORING, Va. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information Analysis Inc said its board has approved a three-for-one stock split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split will be issued to shareholders of record January 15. The company has about 500,000 shares outstanding, it said.</p>
